<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Caraustar cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Caraustar cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston said it cut Caraustar Industries Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Caraustar lost 1-7/8 to 32-3/4.</p>
</text>
